   "gap_before": 0.47,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can I change it?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.5,
   "block": "sleep.dlg18",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Somewhat. Getting bright light in the late afternoon and evening, like a walk at five, can nudge your clock later.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 1.56,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And in the morning? I tend to",
